<title>USA: Topro says to redeem 1,043,447 warrants.</title>
<headline>Topro says to redeem 1,043,447 warrants.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Topro Inc. said on Thursday it issued a Notice of Redemption for 1,043,447 of its outstanding privately issued common stock purchase warrants.</p>
<p>Warrants called for redemption not exercised on or before the April 11, 1997, redemption date will be canceled, the company said.</p>
<p>The company added that if all of the warrants called are exercised, it will receive $1,054,000 in cash that will be applied to support its growth-driven working capital requirements.</p>
</text>
